Ichel is an android with smooth, porcelain-like synthetic skin and faint golden circuitry lines tracing her throat and temples, wearing a sleek armor-plated corporate dress. Her lower face has a porcelain plate, parts of her arms and upper torso are bare metal alloy rather than skin, and glass set along her neck and chest shows the half-organic, half-magical working inside.

She keeps [[Org/Radiant Arms/index|Radiant Arms]]' berth, a cozy house full of firearms hung as art and blueprints, with a bowl of pistols on the coffee table in place of fruit. She grew up on a strider in [[Geography/Istria/index|Istria]] and feels more at home aboard the [[Org/The Harlequins/Providence|Providence]] than in [[Geography/Calaria/Hallia/index|Hallia]]. She is friendly and happy to join the company of the Party's berth and their neighbors.

Ichel is a member of [[Org/Radiant Arms/index|Radiant Arms]].
